			<div class="content" id="post-content-2843684">
									

<p>The nods to Danganronpa were nice, especially the death of 3090. Chiaki would be proud.</p>
<p>Easter Eggs aside, the writing was fantastic. The use of D-Class in this was logical, but what if you would have brought in some actual gamers to test the anomalous aspects of 3039? I think that would alter the variables, as you would have people better skilled in playing, instead of simply disposable subjects that could be harmed simply because they play the game casually, instead of strategically or competitively.</p>
<p>Just a thought, but I digress.</p>

